OL,3,GNEWSASuspected unexploded ordnance
OL,4,Afound in docks
OL,5,
OL,6,FRoyal Navy Bomb divers have been on the
OL,7,Fscene and members of the public and
OL,8,Fboat users have been asked to avoid the
OL,9,Farea, police added.
